<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - General Re cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - General Re cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it downgraded General Re Corp to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 3/8 to 154 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
